cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization or reproducibility package, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this repository."
title: "Unforced Navier-Stokes: Lean Audit and Reproducibility Package"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Newton
    given-names: Tony
    email: tony.newton79@gmail.com
    affiliation: Newton Astro Labs
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 abstract closure formalization and reproducibility package accompanying
  the manuscript "Unforced Finite-Time Blow-Up for Navier-Stokes: Exact Nonlinear
  Closure on the Three-Dimensional Periodic Torus". The current formalization
  covers the abstract closure layer and does not yet constitute a machine-checked
  proof of the full PDE theorem.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - Navier-Stokes
  - partial differential equations
  - formal verification
  - reproducibility
